{"slug":"/components/logins","title":"Animated Login Pages for React — Planes","desc":"Animated React login and sign-in pages: a terminal-style login, a portal login and an auth form, with light and dark mode.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 md:px-10 lg:px-14 xl:px-16\"><section><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl pb-10 pt-2 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Animated Login Pages for React</h1><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Sign-in screens with some character. A login that runs like a terminal session, a portal scene, and a plain auth form for sign in and sign up. The fields, labels and submit handlers are props, so they wire into any auth provider.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] text-muted-foreground/70\">3<!-- --> components ·<!-- --> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/components\">Browse all components</a></p></div><h2 class=\"sr-only\">Components</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group relative flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-secondary/50 p-1 transition-colors hover:border-border hover:bg-secondary\" href=\"/components/portal-login\"><div class=\"aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-muted\"><img src=\"/thumbs/portal-login.webp\" alt=\"Portal Login preview\" width=\"960\" height=\"557\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></div><div class=\"px-1.5 pb-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><h3 class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[13px] font-medium text-foreground p-1\">Portal Login</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground/50\" aria-label=\"Pro\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\